  <running_head>Castigatio Paral.</running_head>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1">sione fidei &amp; pietate perseverare, ipsi</l>
    <l n="2">vero peccatores in posterum a pecca-</l>
    <l n="3">tis abstinere. Hi fuerunt satisfactionis</l>
    <l n="4">ecclesiasticæ fines, neutiquam vero ut</l>
    <l n="5">essent meritoriæ coram tribunali Dei.</l>
    <l n="6">Atque hanc satisfactionem ecclesiasti-</l>
    <l n="7">cam tanquam utilem approbamus.</l>
    <l n="8" para="true">Satisfactio ecclesiæ novæ papisticæ</l>
    <l n="9">a priori toto cœlo distat, &amp; partim ex</l>
    <l n="10">Concilio Tridentino sess. XIV. partim</l>
    <l n="11">ex aliis authoribus definiri potest, <i>quâ</i>
    </l>
    <l n="12">
      <i>homo, qui mortaliter peccavit, post con-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="13">
      <i>fessionem sacerdoti factam, opera pœnalia</i>
    </l>
    <l n="14">
      <i>indicta ab alio vel sponte suscepta, præstat,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="15">
      <i>utpote orationes, ieiunia, eleemosy-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="16">
      <i>nas, vigilias, peregrinationes &amp; disci-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="17">
      <i>plinam corporis, ut post culpam remis-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="18">
      <i>sam, Deo satisfaciant pro pœna temporali.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="19" para="true">Primò differt à veteris ecclesiæ sa-</l>
    <l n="20">tisfactionibus, quia illæ nec multæ</l>
    <l n="21">pecuniariæ, nec actus poenales fuerunt,</l>
    <l n="22">sed disciplina ecclesiastica tantùm, &amp;</l>
    <l n="23">satisfactiones ecclesiæ propter scandalum</l>
  </main_text>
